    "heading": "Fortitude",
    "lineStart": 1162,
    "lineEnd": 1166
  },
  "rulesText": "You may expend your **special armor** to resist a consequence of fatigue, weakness, or chemical effects, or to **push yourself** when working with technical skill or handling alchemicals.",
  "commentary": "When you use this ability, tick the special armor box on your playbook sheet. If you \"resist a consequence\" of the appropriate type, you avoid it completely. If you use this ability to push yourself, you get one of the benefits (+1d, +1 effect, act despite severe harm) but you don't take 2 stress. Your special armor is restored at the beginning of downtime.",
  "abilityScope": "character"
}
